理由の説明と六人の任命を求める共同声明を発表しました。こんなことは日本の歴史…"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/426", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/428", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/430", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/432", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/434", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/436", "sentence": ["…でも共助でもなく公助ですよ、まさに。損失補填、これを求めます。コロナで売上げが減った事業者に対する持続化給付金の執行状況を説明してください。"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/438", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/440", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/442", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/444", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/446", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/448", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/450", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/452", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/454", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/456", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/458", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/460", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/462", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/464", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/466", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/468", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X002202011